06:06.480 --> 06:07.200
Frère Rong, il y a, il y a...

06:07.200 --> 06:07.840
Police !

06:09.320 --> 06:09.920
Posez votre arme !

06:10.240 --> 06:10.680
Reculez !

06:12.080 --> 06:12.720
Baisse ton arme.

06:12.840 --> 06:13.680
Baisse-la.

06:13.760 --> 06:14.560
Baisse-la.

06:15.360 --> 06:16.560
Baisse, baisse, baisse.

06:16.720 --> 06:17.480
Baisse-la.

06:18.000 --> 06:18.640
Baisse-la.

06:19.320 --> 06:20.640
Baisse-la.

06:22.720 --> 06:23.320
Baisse-la.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.520
